This directory contains various tools that use a FTDI usb2spi cable,
http://www.ftdichip.com/Support/Documents/DataSheets/Cables/DS_C232HM_MPSSE_CABLE.PDF
to have your goobuntu machine play SPI master to a slave device.

Tools are built by statically compiling and linking against ../third_party/libftdi and libmpsse, per ./Makefile

BUILD DEPENDENCIES:
sudo apt-get install libusb-1.0
